BJDvoxe7oShTxKT7xVQlqT_BA7wzZSqBhrFVaUfzVlBXoEYfECsAxn-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbSLLgWtNdYurHDwRE0_fg0Yxl0XtqbadxcIbkTMf7Yw&oe=6B046953"}, "display_name": "Dinosaur Prehistoric Hunter VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Step into a dangerous prehistoric VR world where survival means hunting or being hunted. In Dinosaur Prehistoric Hunter VR, you explore a dense jungle packed with 9 deadly dinosaur species, including the legendary T-Rex and fast, aggressive raptors. Every creature has lifelike animations and smart AI that can chase, attack, and corner you.\n\nArm yourself with a powerful MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword and choose your combat style. Go loud in intense firefights, pick off enemies from a distance, or take the close-range path and slash through the danger with a sword. With survival tension, free-hunt exploration, and nonstop dinosaur action, every session feels different.\n\nBuilt for Meta Quest, the game features immersive 3D sound, detailed environments, intuitive VR controls, and optimized performance for a smooth headset experience.", "short_description": "Enter a thrilling prehistoric VR survival hunt where every encounter can turn deadly. Fight 9 dinosaur species, including T-Rex and raptors, using MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword. Explore a dense jungle, survive intense close-range combat, and enjoy realistic graphics, immersive 3D audio, and smooth Meta Quest controls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ab Dur Rehman", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710